{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49423","headline":"酒泉子 · 牛希济","name":"酒泉子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枕转簟凉，清晓远钟残梦。\n月光斜，帘影动，旧炉香。\n梦中说尽相思事，纤手匀双泪。\n去年书，今日意，断人肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}